  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Tests",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Petición exitosa (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// =======================",
                  "// Status",
                  "// =======================",
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// =======================",
                  "// Helmet",
                  "// =======================",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene X-Frame-Options\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Frame-Options\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene X-Content-Type-Options\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Content-Type-Options\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Referrer-Policy\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Referrer-Policy\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Origin-Agent-Cluster\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Origin-Agent-Cluster\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// =======================",
                  "// CORS",
                  "// =======================",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// =======================",
                  "// Rate Limit",
                  "// =======================",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene header RateLimit\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"RateLimit-Limit\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene header RateLimit-Policy\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"RateLimit-Policy\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// =======================",
                  "// Estructura respuesta",
                  "// =======================",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene success\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"success\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene message\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"message\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene timestamp\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"timestamp\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Origin",
                "value": "http://localhost:5173",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Endpoint:** `GET {{BASE}}/health`\n\n**Respuesta exitosa esperada:** código `200 OK`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Error de validación (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "// Status\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Status 400\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "// Helmet\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene X-Frame-Options\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Frame-Options\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene X-Content-Type-Options\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Content-Type-Options\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Referrer-Policy\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Referrer-Policy\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Origin-Agent-Cluster\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Origin-Agent-Cluster\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "// CORS\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "// Rate Limit\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene header RateLimit\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"RateLimit-Limit\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene header RateLimit-Policy\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"RateLimit-Policy\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "// Estructura respuesta\r",
                  "// =======================\r",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene success\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"success\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene message\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"message\");\r",
                  "});\r",
                  "\r",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene timestamp\", () => {\r",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"timestamp\");\r",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Origin",
                "value": "http://localhost:5173",
                "description": "origin de development",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n    \"name\":\"Martin\",\r\n    \"email\": \"martin@example.com\",\r\n    \"password\": \"Mar\"\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Esta solicitud demuestra un error de validación **400 Bad Request** en el endpoint de registro. El resultado esperado es que el servidor rechace la solicitud y devuelva una respuesta 400 con detalles generales sobre los campos que no pasaron la validación."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rate Limit excedido (429)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n    \"name\":\"Martin\",\r\n    \"email\": \"martin@example.com\",\r\n    \"password\": \"Mar\"\r\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El servidor debe responder con código **429 Too Many Requests** e indicar que se debe intentar nuevamente más tarde.\n\nBody de ejemplo. Enviar 6 veces.\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"name\":\"Martin\",\n    \"email\": \"martin@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Mar\"\n}\n\n ```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Error no controlado (500)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/error",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "error"
              ]
            },
            "description": "## Propósito\n\nValida el comportamiento del servidor ante un error no controlado.\n\n## Método y endpoint\n\n`GET {{BASE}}/error`\n\n## Respuesta esperada (500)\n\nRetorna un error interno del servidor con una respuesta similar a:\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"statusCode\": 500,\n  \"message\": \"Internal server error\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-04T15:33:31.366Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/error\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n## Nota\n\nEste endpoint se utiliza para validar el manejo de errores no controlados del servidor."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
